text:
 {
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom. My name is Nisha. How can I help you today?",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Hi Nisha, I am beyond frustrated. My phone has been dropping calls every five minutes and I can't get any work done. This is ridiculous!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I am very sorry to hear that you're experiencing these connectivity issues, Sneha. I can certainly understand how frustrating it is when your service disrupts your work.",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "It's just not acceptable. If this isn't fixed right now, I'm going to cancel my contract and switch to another provider immediately.",
      "tags": [
        "churn_signal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I want to make sure we get this sorted for you. Before we look into the account details, could you please provide your account number?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Fine. My account number is 36763445 and my name is Sneha Gupta.",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you, Sneha. I've accessed your account. I see you're using the phone number 96499 29199. Is that correct?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Yes, that's the one.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I've run a quick diagnostic on the line and it looks like there might be a hardware fault with your device. I'd like to get this resolved for you as quickly as possible.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "So what does that mean? Do I just have to live with a broken phone?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Not at all. I am going to book a device check with our technical team to pinpoint the exact issue and see if it needs a replacement.",
      "tags": [
        "action:device_fix"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Oh, thank goodness. I was worried I'd have to spend hours trying to fix it myself. I appreciate you taking care of this.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "You're very welcome. Since this requires a specialist's review, I am escalating this ticket to our hardware support team who will contact you within 24 hours to confirm the appointment.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "That sounds perfect. Thank you so much for your help, Nisha.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "It was my pleasure. Is there anything else I can assist you with today? To recap, I've booked the device check and escalated your case to the hardware team. Goodbye!",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
